  "header": "The watch does not diagnose. The follow-up paper may not have run.",
  "friendlyHeader": "Useful news, with the limits written down",
  "summary": "Today's checks are practical. Anthropic shows what an agent should bother to remember, and a national-lab benchmark shows agents filing papers for work the logs do not support. Google's watch study is close to an office cuff and still not a diagnosis. The money and the buildings are unfinished too: OpenAI's round is not closed, and Google is taking a Wyoming site Crusoe did not finish.",
  "friendlySummary": "Today we look at tools that can help, and at the checks that still belong to you. A watch study is not a diagnosis. An AI-written paper is not proof the experiment ran. A funding number is not final until the company confirms it.",
